@startuml
' 第七週（claude 版本）：is-a（繼承）與 has-a（欄位關聯）的對照。
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide members

class Member
class VipMember
class Rover
class HeavyRover
class Flashlight
class Battery
class Mission

Member <|-- VipMember : is-a
Rover <|-- HeavyRover : is-a
Flashlight --> "1" Battery : has-a
Mission --> "1" Rover : has-a
@enduml
